  "id": "social-pragmatic-communication-disorder",
  "term": "social (pragmatic) communication disorder",
  "definition": "Social (pragmatic) communication disorder is a communication disorder marked by difficulties with social communication and social interaction, especially pragmatic language use. Unlike autism spectrum disorder, it does not include restricted or repetitive patterns of behavior, interests, or activities.",
